
~ ambushed
Wizard: [font_size=80]Well well well. [/font_size]
Wizard: What doth we have here? A lone [shake level=7 rate=30][i]pint-size[/i][/shake]?
Fenn: Why do you call me that? I'm Fenn.
Wizard: Well, [shake level=7 rate=30]Fenn.[/shake] [wait=0.2]If that [wave freq=7 amp=30]even is thine real nameth.[/wave] [wait=0.2]Um...[wait=0.2] I don't knoweth...
Wizard: Um... [wait=0.2]I hath lost my traineth of thought.
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit(".2")
Fenn: Uh...
Wizard: [font_size=80]Aha,[/font_size] of course! 
Wizard: [font_size=100][shake level=7 rate=30]Ambushing thee![/shake][/font_size]
Wizard: Treadeth carefully, [shake level=7 rate=30][i]pint-size.[/i][/shake] 
Wizard: T'wouldst be such a shame if thee were crushed by my creations.
Az: [i]cough[/i] Fenn, you good over there?
Wizard: [font_size=70][shake level=7 rate=30]WHAT? WHO'S THERE? A GHOSTLY SPIRIT OF MINE OWN IMAGINATION?![/shake][/font_size]
Fenn: I'm good, Az. Wizard man is just ambushing me.
Wizard: [color="red"]AZ[/color]? Liketh apprentice [color="red"]Az[/color]? Like, like [color="red"][i]Az [shake level=7 rate=30]Featherstone[/shake][/i][/color], [color="red"]Az[/color]?
Fenn: Yeah. [wait=0.2]We're like-eth best friends.
Az: Uh. [wait=0.2]Sure.
Wizard: Wherefore is the lady? [wait=0.2][shake level=7 rate=40]How doth she be talking?[/shake]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.2")
Fenn: Oh! Az made these cool frienship bracelets-
Az: [i]Bangles[/i]
Fenn: Bangles. And we can talk through them!
Wizard: No matter! [wait=0.2]Speaketh not anymore of this curs'd device. [wait=0.2]This changes [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30]nothing![/shake][/font_size]
Wizard: [font_size=100][shake level=10 rate=50]TAKETH THIS![/shake][/font_size]
do EventFlags.set_flag("Ws-Ambush-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END


~ escaped
Az: Haha! Nice work, kid!
Wizard: INCONCEIVABLE! ARRRGH!
Wizard: HOW DIDST THOU EVADE MINE OWN ATTACKS?!
Fenn: Oh, well Az can also grab things from far away using these bracelets-
Az: Ban- nevermind.
Wizard: Arrgh. I need to do-eth better! More machines, more snoweth, more creatures.
Az: Yeah. [i]cough[/i]. I'm not gonna lie, that was pretty pathetic.
Wizard: Grrr. Well, I doubteth thee has't any more stupid tricks up thy sleeve.
Fenn: Wasn't it so cool?
Wizard: I hath never said it was cool!
Wizard: ARRGH!!!!!
Wizard runs off
do EventFlags.set_flag("Ws-PostAmbush-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END
#Should be used for both the pre-ambush conversation and post-ambush conversation
